WEBVTT

00:00:04.730 --> 00:00:07.320
Wanted posters, huh...

00:00:07.650 --> 00:00:08.690
Let's see...

00:00:08.690 --> 00:00:10.110
"If you see these people,

00:00:10.110 --> 00:00:12.490
report to the castle immediately."

00:00:12.650 --> 00:00:13.610
That's what it says.

00:00:13.610 --> 00:00:16.870
Ruffians challenging the Queen, eh?

00:00:16.870 --> 00:00:18.330
I don't want to say this out loud,

00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:20.790
but I bet tons of people 
are secretly supporting them.

00:00:20.790 --> 00:00:22.830
There are people for 
and against the Queen.

00:00:22.830 --> 00:00:25.080
It's not too big in Gainos yet,

00:00:25.080 --> 00:00:28.210
but in the outskirts, 
unrest is growing.

00:00:28.210 --> 00:00:32.550
Jeez, are we ever going 
to have peace in our time?

00:00:36.340 --> 00:00:39.350
We've put up the notices 
all across the continent.

00:00:39.350 --> 00:00:41.810
They shouldn't be able to move 
around very freely much longer.

00:00:41.810 --> 00:00:43.850
What are you talking about?

00:00:44.390 --> 00:00:46.810
It's your fault that everything 
turned out this way.

00:00:47.190 --> 00:00:49.150
Iron Strategist? Yeah, right.

00:00:49.520 --> 00:00:51.150
I've received word that 
beautiful warriors

00:00:51.150 --> 00:00:54.570
have begun to make their moves
all across the continent.

00:00:54.570 --> 00:00:58.410
There seems to be an annoying 
ape moving around in the east.

00:00:58.410 --> 00:00:59.450
What are you going to do about that?

00:00:59.700 --> 00:01:01.700
You do something about it.

00:01:01.700 --> 00:01:02.830
Huh?

00:01:02.830 --> 00:01:04.710
That's a job for the 
Fang Assassins.

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:06.210
Make sure you take care of it.

00:01:07.130 --> 00:01:09.170
Who'd listen to you?!

00:01:17.010 --> 00:01:18.680
Onee-sama...

00:01:18.680 --> 00:01:20.810
The Strategist's will is my will.

00:01:21.060 --> 00:01:23.560
Take out the beautiful warriors, Elina.

00:01:23.850 --> 00:01:25.600
Y-Yes ma'am!

00:01:25.600 --> 00:01:27.060
Her eyes...

00:01:27.060 --> 00:01:28.440
The way she said that...

00:01:28.440 --> 00:01:31.860
Ever since Onee-sama became the Queen...

00:01:31.860 --> 00:01:33.190
I'm getting chills!

00:01:35.070 --> 00:01:38.160
We first need to get her back...

00:01:38.530 --> 00:01:40.870
In order to fight the Kreutz girl,

00:01:40.870 --> 00:01:43.160
we need the best warrior for the job.

00:01:44.500 --> 00:01:49.500
I was born crying alone.

00:01:49.500 --> 00:01:55.010
In a horizon of light and darkness.

00:01:55.010 --> 00:02:00.350
Why not obtain these bonds.

00:02:00.350 --> 00:02:08.690
They were shining in my hands just now.

00:02:16.490 --> 00:02:21.570
The melancholy of one in sever billion.

00:02:21.570 --> 00:02:26.910
Someday the end of the world will come.

00:02:26.910 --> 00:02:32.290
So what? I'll have no regret.

00:02:32.290 --> 00:02:40.720
Say, yeah!! Stop running straight after that falling star.

00:02:40.720 --> 00:02:45.520
Let your worries fade away!!

00:02:45.520 --> 00:02:50.810
This blue Earth is nestled in the sky.

00:02:50.810 --> 00:02:56.150
Like I always envisioned Elysium.

00:02:56.150 --> 00:03:01.490
I will shape my own past and future.

00:03:01.610 --> 00:03:06.870
I will look up to the eternal Stellar.

00:03:06.870 --> 00:03:12.290
I can hear the song of life.

00:03:36.820 --> 00:03:40.070
Oh... I'll hang these up in my room.

00:04:13.770 --> 00:04:15.770
I did it again.

00:04:19.070 --> 00:04:20.820
There we go.

00:04:21.820 --> 00:04:23.110
Oh, yeah!

00:04:23.110 --> 00:04:25.070
I need to go shopping for dinner

00:04:25.070 --> 00:04:27.780
before my husband comes back.

00:04:27.780 --> 00:04:30.200
Hi there!

00:04:32.660 --> 00:04:34.170
Hey, take a look over here!

00:04:34.170 --> 00:04:35.710
We've got low prices.

00:04:35.710 --> 00:04:37.040
Good afternoon, mister.

00:04:37.880 --> 00:04:39.590
Oh, welcome.

00:04:39.590 --> 00:04:41.460
What would you like today?

00:04:41.460 --> 00:04:44.510
Let's see... I'd like some fish.

00:04:44.510 --> 00:04:46.590
Oh, I've got some nice stuff in.

00:04:46.590 --> 00:04:47.640
Take a look.

00:04:48.260 --> 00:04:50.350
Wow! It's fresh!

00:04:50.350 --> 00:04:52.930
I'm going to dry it, so 
could you open it for me!

00:04:53.020 --> 00:04:54.600
Huh?

00:04:56.690 --> 00:04:59.020
And then she...

00:04:59.980 --> 00:05:01.860
Oh, there she is.

00:05:01.860 --> 00:05:03.190
She looks like she's doing well.

00:05:03.610 --> 00:05:06.450
I wasn't sure what was 
going to happen to her

00:05:06.450 --> 00:05:08.320
when she wandered in here 
after losing her memories.

00:05:08.910 --> 00:05:10.950
But then she met someone nice,

00:05:10.950 --> 00:05:13.290
and now she looks really happy.

00:05:13.290 --> 00:05:15.040
I'm glad for her.

00:05:15.960 --> 00:05:17.750
Oh, these are cute!

00:05:26.380 --> 00:05:28.930
I wonder if my husband 
would like these.

00:05:32.600 --> 00:05:35.180
"It's the duty of a young wife

00:05:35.180 --> 00:05:37.940
to pay attention to her 
husband's health and, at times,

00:05:37.940 --> 00:05:40.310
tend to him like a mother would."

00:05:40.860 --> 00:05:42.020
I see.

00:05:51.240 --> 00:05:54.410
I pray my husband will stay healthy.

00:05:54.950 --> 00:05:56.910
You're quite dedicated.

00:05:59.830 --> 00:06:02.000
Oh, Inquisitor!

00:06:02.000 --> 00:06:03.960
How is your memory?

00:06:05.340 --> 00:06:08.590
I... still don't really 
remember anything.

00:06:09.220 --> 00:06:11.050
But my husband always

00:06:11.050 --> 00:06:13.510
tells me I should take my time remembering.

00:06:17.440 --> 00:06:20.770
God doesn't always give trials.

00:06:20.770 --> 00:06:22.360
That smile of yours is

00:06:22.360 --> 00:06:25.280
something precious that 
God has given you.

00:06:28.570 --> 00:06:32.780
I actually did remember one thing, Inquisitor.

00:06:32.780 --> 00:06:33.950
What was it?

00:06:34.330 --> 00:06:37.870
I was searching for my sister,

00:06:37.870 --> 00:06:41.330
but I can't remember her name...

00:06:41.330 --> 00:06:45.340
The only thing I remember is 
that I was looking for her.

00:06:45.340 --> 00:06:46.800
That doesn't really help...

00:06:48.130 --> 00:06:48.880
No.

00:06:51.220 --> 00:06:53.850
Those who believe in God 
will never be abandoned.

00:06:54.350 --> 00:06:56.970
I'm sure you'll see your sister again.

00:06:56.970 --> 00:07:01.230
After all, you have a wonderful 
husband there to help you.

00:07:02.440 --> 00:07:03.650
You're right.

00:07:04.770 --> 00:07:08.650
Dinner will be fish, 
salad, and pot-baked bread.

00:07:08.650 --> 00:07:09.740
Also...

00:07:13.620 --> 00:07:14.990
It's been a while.

00:07:15.370 --> 00:07:18.160
Um... Who might you be?

00:07:18.160 --> 00:07:19.750
An old friend.

00:07:19.830 --> 00:07:23.250
You look like you're doing well, Aldra.

00:07:40.430 --> 00:07:41.980
That's enough.

00:07:42.350 --> 00:07:43.980
It's just not possible.

00:07:43.980 --> 00:07:46.020
As long as that armour isn't functioning,

00:07:46.020 --> 00:07:48.230
it doesn't make sense for you to fight.

00:07:48.320 --> 00:07:49.780
But...

00:07:50.650 --> 00:07:53.110
It's true that you have a good sword...

00:07:53.110 --> 00:07:54.370
I know, right?!

00:07:54.370 --> 00:07:57.030
I can help you, right Onee-sama?

00:07:57.030 --> 00:07:59.080
That doesn't matter.

00:08:00.250 --> 00:08:03.040
That's right. Mirim can't handle it.

00:08:04.130 --> 00:08:05.880
Lunaluna-san!

00:08:05.880 --> 00:08:08.590
Without your vibrating sword and armour,

00:08:08.590 --> 00:08:10.590
you're just a normal country girl.

00:08:10.670 --> 00:08:15.140
You told me you were from 
the countryside, too!

00:08:15.140 --> 00:08:18.310
Not the country, the middle of nowhere.

00:08:19.220 --> 00:08:20.770
Call it unexplored!

00:08:22.350 --> 00:08:26.110
Basically, I'm the only 
one who can help her.

00:08:26.650 --> 00:08:27.730
Lunaluna!

00:08:28.190 --> 00:08:32.360
I won't let go, Nee-nee.

00:08:33.780 --> 00:08:37.490
I guess I can't do anything 
unless this works...

00:08:37.910 --> 00:08:42.160
Well, I can refer to the records 
from the copies I made

00:08:42.160 --> 00:08:44.870
and try to make it usable again, but...

00:08:44.870 --> 00:08:46.790
Really, Yuit-chan?!

00:08:46.920 --> 00:08:47.960
But...

00:08:47.960 --> 00:08:49.420
I wouldn't count on it work—

00:08:49.420 --> 00:08:51.420
Thank you, Yuit-chan!

00:08:51.710 --> 00:08:53.670
Um...

00:08:56.140 --> 00:09:02.060
I'm sitting next to Onii-chan 
today no matter what!

00:09:02.060 --> 00:09:04.810
I want to sit next to Onee-sama, too!

00:09:04.810 --> 00:09:06.440
Well, hurry up and pick, you two.

00:09:06.440 --> 00:09:09.940
I obviously always have 
a seat next to her.

00:09:10.020 --> 00:09:14.200
Why just you?! 
I gave up my seat yesterday!

00:09:14.200 --> 00:09:15.400
That was yesterday.

00:09:15.400 --> 00:09:16.740
We're talking about today here.

00:09:16.740 --> 00:09:18.620
You piss me off! You piss me off so much!

00:09:19.030 --> 00:09:20.330
Wait a second!

00:09:20.330 --> 00:09:21.990
We made the food,

00:09:21.990 --> 00:09:24.290
so we should have the right 
to sit next to Aneja!

00:09:24.290 --> 00:09:24.960
No!

00:09:26.290 --> 00:09:27.630
They all said no...

00:09:29.250 --> 00:09:31.250
It's the same no matter where we eat...

00:09:31.250 --> 00:09:33.130
The food's going to get cold.

00:09:33.210 --> 00:09:34.590
No, Onii-chan.

00:09:34.590 --> 00:09:37.300
This is actually quite 
a serious problem.

00:09:37.300 --> 00:09:42.140
If I can sit next to you, 
I'll be able to work harder tomorrow!

00:09:42.140 --> 00:09:43.560
It's not that big of a deal...

00:09:43.560 --> 00:09:44.930
Yes, it is!

00:09:46.480 --> 00:09:47.980
They're all agreeing again.

00:09:56.150 --> 00:09:57.400
Come to think of it,

00:09:57.400 --> 00:10:01.240
they finally posted notices 
about you, Onee-sama...

00:10:01.280 --> 00:10:03.240
Yeah, rather late at that.

00:10:03.490 --> 00:10:07.370
It just means that the Queen 
couldn't ignore you any longer.

00:10:07.370 --> 00:10:09.000
You're one step closer.

00:10:09.000 --> 00:10:11.420
I think she would have preferred 
that the Queen ignored her.

00:10:11.500 --> 00:10:15.670
Those notices are a double-edged sword.

00:10:15.670 --> 00:10:17.590
If they succeed, they can 
once again demonstrate

00:10:17.590 --> 00:10:19.890
the power of the Queen to 
everyone across the continent.

00:10:19.890 --> 00:10:21.600
They can quell all of the minor rebellions

00:10:21.600 --> 00:10:24.010
happening across the land at once.

00:10:24.010 --> 00:10:25.180
I see...

00:10:25.180 --> 00:10:26.100
And if they fail...

00:10:27.640 --> 00:10:31.310
That's why I think Ymir must 
have some sort of plan.

00:10:31.310 --> 00:10:32.770
We have to stay vigilant.

00:10:33.020 --> 00:10:35.440
The Queen's kind of annoying.

00:10:35.440 --> 00:10:38.700
Everyone would be happy if you 
became Queen, Nee-nee.

00:10:38.780 --> 00:10:40.240
M-Me?

00:10:40.610 --> 00:10:41.820
Yeah!

00:10:41.820 --> 00:10:44.450
Lunaluna-san has some 
good ideas sometimes.

00:10:44.540 --> 00:10:46.540
Not sometimes. All the time.

00:10:46.620 --> 00:10:50.540
I think I could accept it if 
Aneja became the Queen.

00:10:50.540 --> 00:10:51.710
Like you'd have a choice.

00:10:51.790 --> 00:10:54.380
Queen Annelotte, huh?

00:10:54.380 --> 00:10:56.710
I like the sound of that!

00:10:57.090 --> 00:10:59.300
W-Wait!

00:11:01.800 --> 00:11:04.310
Ruling over people isn't in my nature!

00:11:04.310 --> 00:11:06.270
I'm only a knight!

00:11:06.270 --> 00:11:07.980
What are you talking about?

00:11:07.980 --> 00:11:09.980
We're all from different 
places, raised differently,

00:11:09.980 --> 00:11:12.440
but we've all decided to follow you,

00:11:12.440 --> 00:11:13.730
and now we're here with you.

00:11:18.940 --> 00:11:20.200
But...

00:11:20.200 --> 00:11:22.360
I think you're the only one

00:11:22.360 --> 00:11:25.030
who could have brought us together like this.

00:11:27.580 --> 00:11:29.710
I'm going to get some fresh air.

00:11:29.710 --> 00:11:31.750
Give me some time alone to think.

00:11:31.750 --> 00:11:32.630
Sure.

00:11:32.750 --> 00:11:35.540
But I'm sure there's only 
one thing you can do.

00:11:40.880 --> 00:11:43.760
Nee-nee is so cute when she's 
worrying about stuff!

00:11:43.760 --> 00:11:45.350
Anyway...

00:11:45.350 --> 00:11:47.850
I'm the one sleeping 
next to Aneja tonight!

00:11:47.850 --> 00:11:49.020
Surely you must be joking.

00:11:49.020 --> 00:11:50.850
Obviously I get to sleep next to her!

00:11:50.850 --> 00:11:53.690
Absolutely not! 
Obviously, it should be me!

00:11:53.690 --> 00:11:56.440
How is that obvious at all?

00:11:58.980 --> 00:12:01.860
Vante-san uses saunas, too?

00:12:06.450 --> 00:12:08.620
I brought everyone together...

00:12:08.620 --> 00:12:10.620
I never even thought about that.

00:12:11.460 --> 00:12:13.750
I was so focused, not thinking 
about anything else,

00:12:13.750 --> 00:12:15.960
and just did what I saw before me.

00:12:16.500 --> 00:12:20.300
I can't stand over people 
and command them...

00:12:26.970 --> 00:12:29.970
I'm glad that Yuit and 
the others trust me,

00:12:30.640 --> 00:12:32.430
but I can't...

00:12:33.270 --> 00:12:34.980
I can't become the queen.

00:12:35.850 --> 00:12:38.230
It's true that that would 
be the most certain way

00:12:38.230 --> 00:12:41.360
to bring peace to the continent.

00:12:41.940 --> 00:12:44.150
Could I really lead everyone?

00:12:50.160 --> 00:12:52.250
It's about time to go.

00:13:09.600 --> 00:13:12.770
You want me to be a member 
of the Queen's army?

00:13:12.810 --> 00:13:15.480
But why me?

00:13:15.480 --> 00:13:18.270
As you can see, 
I'm just a simple housewife.

00:13:18.360 --> 00:13:21.440
You have great potential as a summoner.

00:13:21.980 --> 00:13:23.610
I know you don't have any memories,

00:13:24.450 --> 00:13:28.780
but all you have to do 
is follow what's written here.

00:13:29.320 --> 00:13:30.950
Could you try it for me?

00:13:30.950 --> 00:13:31.540
But...

00:13:31.540 --> 00:13:34.830
The head of the rebellion 
is gathering more members,

00:13:34.830 --> 00:13:37.750
and some of my soldiers 
have been lured to her side.

00:13:39.130 --> 00:13:42.550
I wonder if they'll seduce 
your husband, as well.

00:13:43.800 --> 00:13:45.340
My husband?!

00:13:47.340 --> 00:13:49.390
I'll tell you the details later.

00:13:49.390 --> 00:13:52.470
But first, you need 
to awaken your power.

00:14:01.190 --> 00:14:03.190
I'm sorry, God.

00:14:03.190 --> 00:14:05.530
I shall be going against 
you for a short time

00:14:05.530 --> 00:14:08.320
in order to protect my husband.

00:14:22.750 --> 00:14:27.170
When the two moons separate, 
the door will open.

00:14:43.650 --> 00:14:48.110
Beautiful, noble, proud demons,

00:14:48.110 --> 00:14:50.410
answer my call.

00:14:50.410 --> 00:14:54.490
Come forth from the underworld 
with great power

00:14:55.160 --> 00:14:56.660
and enter this world.

00:15:57.760 --> 00:16:01.310
Hi there, thanks for summoning me.

00:16:01.310 --> 00:16:03.150
My name is Belphe.

00:16:03.150 --> 00:16:07.190
It's a pleasure meeting you.

00:16:07.190 --> 00:16:08.780
My name is Dogor.

00:16:09.320 --> 00:16:11.320
Wow!

00:16:11.320 --> 00:16:13.610
I really was able to summon them!

00:16:13.610 --> 00:16:15.160
Nice to meet you.

00:16:15.160 --> 00:16:16.280
I'm Al.

00:16:16.280 --> 00:16:19.450
You're great... really great...

00:16:19.450 --> 00:16:21.120
Totally, right?

00:16:21.120 --> 00:16:24.790
I'm glad we were summoned 
by such a great wife here.

00:16:24.880 --> 00:16:30.710
And you've got quite the 
delicious-looking body there.

00:16:31.170 --> 00:16:36.550
Do... you think we could...

00:16:36.550 --> 00:16:39.100
Let us eat you!

00:16:43.940 --> 00:16:46.520
The book was right.

00:16:46.520 --> 00:16:49.690
This is the best way to make 
your summons listen to you.

00:16:50.230 --> 00:16:53.360
You're pretty good...

00:16:54.450 --> 00:16:56.410
That was great.

00:16:56.700 --> 00:17:00.040
Anyway, Belphe-san. Dogor-san.

00:17:00.040 --> 00:17:03.410
Help me out for a little while, 
so I can help my husband.

00:17:03.830 --> 00:17:05.040
Roger that...

00:17:06.000 --> 00:17:07.540
Understood.

00:17:33.320 --> 00:17:35.360
W-Where am I?

00:17:36.780 --> 00:17:40.030
Where did Aneja go to get some air?

00:17:42.330 --> 00:17:44.750
She never came back, did she?

00:17:44.750 --> 00:17:48.250
Sometimes she worries too much...

00:17:48.960 --> 00:17:52.590
Who's the one who said 
she should become Queen?

00:17:52.590 --> 00:17:54.090
It wasn't me!

00:17:54.090 --> 00:17:55.590
It was the white one.

00:17:55.590 --> 00:17:56.760
They're the same.

00:17:57.220 --> 00:17:59.720
Anyway, let's split up 
and search for her.

00:17:59.720 --> 00:18:00.600
Right.

00:18:05.980 --> 00:18:07.350
Find anything?

00:18:07.770 --> 00:18:09.770
I don't see her.

00:18:10.940 --> 00:18:12.730
I don't smell her either.

00:18:15.150 --> 00:18:18.860
Anyway, why am I stuck with you again?

00:18:18.860 --> 00:18:20.950
I'm not into little kids.

00:18:20.950 --> 00:18:22.950
They put posters up.

00:18:22.950 --> 00:18:25.660
It's dangerous to work alone.

00:18:25.660 --> 00:18:26.540
Also...

00:18:26.960 --> 00:18:29.750
I like you, Lunaluna-san.

00:18:31.130 --> 00:18:33.550
Anyway, we need to get 
back to searching.

00:18:36.130 --> 00:18:36.970
Right!

00:18:38.340 --> 00:18:41.890
Lunaluna-san, what do you 
like about Onee-sama?

00:18:42.260 --> 00:18:43.390
What do you mean?

00:18:43.390 --> 00:18:44.810
I like a lot of things about her.

00:18:44.810 --> 00:18:46.520
I like the way she looks, 
her body, her face...

00:18:46.520 --> 00:18:47.890
That's it?

00:18:48.480 --> 00:18:52.020
She was captured in our village.

00:18:52.020 --> 00:18:55.400
And when I was sleeping 
she escaped, and...

00:18:55.400 --> 00:18:56.360
And?

00:18:56.860 --> 00:18:59.200
And she came back because she learned

00:18:59.200 --> 00:19:01.280
that I was going to be punished.

00:19:01.570 --> 00:19:03.830
She's really a strange one, isn't she?

00:19:03.830 --> 00:19:06.120
Yeah, that's how she is.

00:19:06.120 --> 00:19:07.580
She's always straightforward,

00:19:07.580 --> 00:19:09.870
and tries her hardest with 
whatever she has in front of her.

00:19:09.870 --> 00:19:12.170
She never overlooks anything.

00:19:13.840 --> 00:19:16.380
Being thrice indebted is 
stronger than parental bonds.

00:19:16.920 --> 00:19:19.010
It's important to follow Shai-Fang traditions.

00:19:19.380 --> 00:19:22.430
Hey, Tarnyang, 
if you didn't owe her anything,

00:19:22.430 --> 00:19:23.430
what would you have done?

00:19:24.350 --> 00:19:26.010
What do you mean?

00:19:26.010 --> 00:19:31.400
Do you think we would have 
decided to follow Nee-san anyway?

00:19:34.060 --> 00:19:35.690
Come on, Sainyang!

00:19:35.690 --> 00:19:40.240
We need to hurry up and find 
Aneja before Yuit and Mirim do!

00:19:46.370 --> 00:19:47.660
She'll come back.

00:19:47.660 --> 00:19:49.910
I'm sure Onii-chan will come back.

00:19:49.910 --> 00:19:52.290
It's our destiny, after all.

00:20:08.100 --> 00:20:10.180
I'm sorry, dear.

00:20:11.560 --> 00:20:14.190
I'll be gone for a little while.

00:20:15.110 --> 00:20:18.690
I can't tell you why, 
but I promise I'll be back.

00:20:27.660 --> 00:20:31.410
We'll be leaving soon, 
Belphe-san, Dogor-san.

00:20:32.540 --> 00:20:33.960
Huh?

00:20:36.750 --> 00:20:38.340
Oh no...

00:20:38.340 --> 00:20:41.170
If they get too far away...

00:20:48.220 --> 00:20:49.760
We finally came to this world,

00:20:49.760 --> 00:20:51.270
so we need to have some fun!

00:20:52.270 --> 00:20:54.270
We don't need that terrible food

00:20:54.270 --> 00:20:56.270
when we can eat as many 
humans as we want.

00:20:56.270 --> 00:20:58.360
I want to eat a beautiful warrior.

00:20:58.360 --> 00:21:00.530
A strong, beautiful warrior!

00:21:00.530 --> 00:21:01.940
That sounds good!

00:21:01.940 --> 00:21:03.360
I agree!

00:21:03.360 --> 00:21:05.780
And then, when we come back,

00:21:05.780 --> 00:21:07.990
we'll take our time with the wife.

00:21:09.450 --> 00:21:11.660
That would be great!

00:21:17.670 --> 00:21:20.710
It seems like Elina's taking out the 
beautiful warriors just as planned.

00:21:20.710 --> 00:21:23.050
Aldra will be here shortly.

00:21:23.050 --> 00:21:25.300
There's only one pawn left that we need.

00:21:25.970 --> 00:21:29.100
Bring me Inquisitor Sigui.

00:23:11.410 --> 00:23:13.580
I'm just your normal newly-wed

00:23:13.580 --> 00:23:16.540
that looks good in an apron, 
that you could find anywhere,

00:23:16.540 --> 00:23:19.250
but I've summoned some scary demons!

00:23:19.250 --> 00:23:21.750
Now bring it on!

00:23:21.750 --> 00:23:24.670
I'll give it my all to protect my husband!

00:23:25.420 --> 00:23:27.760
Next time: "A Samurai Arrives!"

00:23:28.170 --> 00:23:33.300
Oh no! Belphe-san and Dogor-san have disappeared.

00:23:33.300 --> 00:23:36.140
Samurai-san from 
the Land of the Rising Sun,

00:23:36.140 --> 00:23:38.350
have you seen them?
